an begin="00:16.971" end="00:17.235">now </span><span begin="00:17.235" end="00:17.603">I </span><span begin="00:17.603" end="00:17.963">am </span><span begin="00:17.963" end="00:19.147">blind</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:19.827" end="00:22.467"><span begin="00:19.827" end="00:19.995">With </span><span begin="00:19.995" end="00:20.299">all </span><span begin="00:20.299" end="00:20.676">this </span><span begin="00:20.676" end="00:21.091">anger </span><span begin="00:21.259" end="00:21.515">guilt </span><span begin="00:21.515" end="00:21.907">and </span><span begin="00:21.907" end="00:22.307">sadness</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.467" end="00:24.771"><span begin="00:22.467" end="00:22.779">Coming </span><span begin="00:22.915" end="00:23.171">to </span><span begin="00:23.171" end="00:23.403">haunt </span><span begin="00:23.539" end="00:23.707">me </span><span begin="00:23.707" end="00:24.555">forever</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.771" end="00:30.347"><span begin="00:24.771" end="00:24.963">I </span><span begin="00:24.963" end="00:25.275">can't </span><span begin="00:25.275" end="00:25.579">wait </span><span begin="00:25.579" end="00:25.915">for </span><span begin="00:25.915" end="00:26.171">the </span><span begin="00:26.171" end="00:26.435">cliff </span><span begin="00:26.603" end="00:26.755">at </span><span begin="00:26.755" end="00:26.947">the </span><span begin="00:26.947" end="00:27.227">end </span><span begin="00:27.227" end="00:27.403">of </span><span begin="00:27.403" end="00:27.611">the </span><span begin="00:27.611" end="00:28.467">river</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.347" end="00:32.193"><span begin="00:30.347" end="00:30.531">Is </span><span begin="00:30.531" end="00:30.683">this </span><span begin="00:30.683" end="00:31.018">revenge </span><span begin="00:31.018" end="00:31.193">I </span><span begin="00:31.193" end="00:31.361">am </span><span begin="00:31.361" end="00:31.881">seeking</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.193" end="00:34.721"><span begin="00:32.193" end="00:32.441">Or </span><span begin="00:32.441" end="00:32.865">seeking </span><span begin="00:33.017" end="00:33.249">someone </span><span begin="00:33.249" end="00:33.473">to </span><span begin="00:33.473" end="00:33.913">avenge </span><span begin="00:34.049" end="00:34.401">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.721" end="00:39.698"><span begin="00:34.721" end="00:35.009">Stuck </span><span begin="00:35.009" end="00:35.177">in </span><span begin="00:35.177" end="00:35.401">my </span><span begin="00:35.401" end="00:35.625">own </span><span begin="00:35.625" end="00:36.275">paradox </span><span begin="00:36.443" end="00:36.635">I </span><span begin="00:36.635" end="00:36.899">wanna </span><span begin="00:36.899" end="00:37.163">set </span><span begin="00:37.163" end="00:37.634">myself </span><span begin="00:37.834" end="00:38.322">free</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.698" end="00:42.348"><span begin="00:39.698" end="00:40.188">Maybe </span><span begin="00:40.188" end="00:40.492">I </span><span begin="00:40.492" end="00:40.884">should </span><span begin="00:40.884" end="00:41.276">chase </span><span begin="00:41.276" end="00:41.796">and </span><span begin="00:41.796" end="00:42.132">find</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.348" end="00:44.732"><span begin="00:42.348" end="00:42.692">Before </span><span begin="00:42.692" end="00:43.060">they'll </span><span begin="00:43.060" end="00:43.388">try </span><span begin="00:43.388" end="00:43.677">to </span><span begin="00:43.677" end="00:43.956">stop </span><span begin="00:43.956" end="00:44.348">it</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.732" end="00:50.020"><span begin="00:44.732" end="00:44.916">It </span><span begin="00:44.916" end="00:45.132">won't </span><span begin="00:45.132" end="00:45.556">be </span><span begin="00:45.556" end="00:45.924">long </span><span begin="00:45.924" end="00:46.332">before </span><span begin="00:46.532" end="00:46.804">I'll </span><span begin="00:46.804" end="00:47.124">become </span><span begin="00:47.292" end="00:47.500">a </span><span begin="00:47.500" end="00:48.548">puppet</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.020" end="00:52.247"><span begin="00:50.020" end="00:50.120">It's </span><span begin="00:50.120" end="00:50.351">been </span><span begin="00:50.567" end="00:50.959">so </span><span begin="00:50.959" end="00:51.976">long</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.247" end="00:54.375"><span begin="00:52.247" end="00:52.479">Since </span><span begin="00:52.479" end="00:52.719">I </span><span begin="00:52.719" end="00:52.999">last </span><span begin="00:52.999" end="00:53.231">have </span><span begin="00:53.231" end="00:53.479">seen </span><span begin="00:53.479" end="00:53.687">my </span><span begin="00:53.687" end="00:54.215">son</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.375" end="00:56.031"><span begin="00:54.375" end="00:54.527">Lost </span><span begin="00:54.527" end="00:54.719">to </span><span begin="00:54.719" end="00:54.919">this </span><span begin="00:54.919" end="00:55.543">monster</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.031" end="00:59.711"><span begin="00:56.031" end="00:56.191">To </span><span begin="00:56.191" end="00:56.351">the </span><span begin="00:56.351" end="00:56.599">man </span><span begin="00:56.599" end="00:57.063">behind </span><span begin="00:57.207" end="00:57.463">the </span><span begin="00:57.463" end="00:58.175">slaughter</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.711" end="01:02.088"><span begin="00:59.711" end="01:00.015">Since </span><span begin="01:00.015" end="01:00.439">you've </span><span begin="01:00.663" end="01:01.047">been </span><span begin="01:01.047" end="01:01.744">gone</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.088" end="01:04.138"><span begin="01:02.088" end="01:02.311">I've </span><span begin="01:02.311" end="01:02.511">been </span><span begin="01:02.511" end="01:02.951">singing </span><span begin="01:03.127" end="01:03.335">this </span><span begin="01:03.335" end="01:03.706">stupid </span><span begin="01:03.706" end="01:04.138">song</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.138" end="01:05.978"><span begin="01:04.138" end="01:04.482">So </span><span begin="01:04.482" end="01:04.738">I </span><span begin="01:04.738" end="01:04.993">could </span><span begin="01:04.993" end="01:05.738">ponder</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.978" end="01:30.330"><span begin="01:05.978" end="01:06.234">The </span><span begin="01:06.234" end="01:06.818">sanity </span><span begin="01:07.042" end="01:07.250">of </span><span begin="01:07.250" end="01:07.505">your </span><span begin="01:07.505" end="01:07.990">mother</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.330" end="01:32.106"><span begin="01:30.330" end="01:30.514">I </span><span begin="01:30.514" end="01:30.666">wish </span><span begin="01:30.666" end="01:30.794">I </span><span begin="01:30.794" end="01:30.938">lived </span><span begin="01:30.938" end="01:31.106">in </span><span begin="01:31.106" end="01:31.226">the </span><span begin="01:31.226" end="01:31.858">present</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.106" end="01:34.674"><span begin="01:32.106" end="01:32.266">With </span><span begin="01:32.266" end="01:32.426">the </span><span begin="01:32.426" end="01:32.682">gift </span><span begin="01:32.682" end="01:32.858">of </span><span begin="01:32.858" end="01:33.114">my </span><span begin="01:33.114" end="01:33.378">past </span><span begin="01:33.530" end="01:34.450">mistakes</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:34.674" end="01:39.746"><span begin="01:34.674" end="01:34.834">But </span><span begin="01:34.834" end="01:34.970">the </span><span begin="01:34.970" end="01:35.274">future </span><span begin="01:35.417" end="01:35.618">keeps </span><span begin="01:35.618" end="01:35.986">luring </span><span begin="01:35.986" end="01:36.410">in </span><span begin="01:36.410" end="01:36.658">like </span><span begin="01:36.658" end="01:36.930">a </span><span begin="01:36.930" end="01:37.162">pack </span><span begin="01:37.162" end="01:37.386">of </span><span begin="01:37.386" end="01:38.346">snakes</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:39.746" end="01:44.728"><span begin="01:39.746" end="01:39.978">Your </span><span begin="01:39.978" end="01:40.317">sweet </span><span begin="01:40.605" end="01:40.901">little </span><span begin="01:41.133" end="01:41.501">eyes </span><span begin="01:41.749" end="01:41.957">your </span><span begin="01:41.957" end="01:42.174">little </span><span begin="01:42.357" end="01:42.717">smile </span><span begin="01:42.933" end="01:43.149">is </span><span begin="01:43.149" end="01:43.389">all </span><span begin="01:43.389" end="01:43.613">I </span><span begin="01:43.613" end="01:44.464">remember</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.728" end="01:50.356"><span begin="01:44.728" end="01:44.976">Those </span><span begin="01:44.976" end="01:45.560">fuzzy </span><span begin="01:45.560" end="01:46.468">memories </span><span begin="01:46.684" end="01:46.916">mess </span><span begin="01:46.916" end="01:47.172">with </span><span begin="01:47.172" end="01:47.404">my </span><span begin="01:47.404" end="01:48.252">temper</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:50.356" end="01:54.777"><span begin="01:50.356" end="01:50.909">Justification </span><span begin="01:51.092" end="01:51.252">is </span><span begin="01:51.252" end="01:51.601">killing </span><span begin="01:51.601" end="01:51.921">me </span><span begin="01:52.321" end="01:52.513">but </span><span begin="01:52.513" end="01:52.833">killing </span><span begin="01:52.833" end="01:53.113">isn't </span><span begin="01:53.113" end="01:54.561">justified</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.777" end="01:59.801"><span begin="01:54.777" end="01:55.001">What </span><span begin="01:55.001" end="01:55.497">happened </span><span begin="01:55.497" end="01:55.785">to </span><span begin="01:55.785" end="01:56.233">my </span><span begin="01:56.233" end="01:56.513">son </span><span begin="01:56.513" end="01:56.953">I'm </span><span begin="01:56.953" end="01:58.377">terrified</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:59.801" end="02:04.817"><span begin="01:59.801" end="02:00.051">It </span><span begin="02:00.051" end="02:00.481">lingers </span><span begin="02:00.689" end="02:00.953">in </span><span begin="02:00.953" end="02:01.233">my </span><span begin="02:01.233" end="02:01.449">mind </span><span begin="02:01.633" end="02:01.874">and </span><span begin="02:01.874" end="02:02.153">the </span><span begin="02:02.153" end="02:02.481">thought </span><span begin="02:02.633" end="02:02.865">keeps </span><span begin="02:02.865" end="02:03.153">on </span><span begin="02:03.153" end="02:03.553">getting </span><span begin="02:03.697" end="02:04.585">bigger</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:04.817" end="02:09.494"><span begin="02:04.817" end="02:05.041">I'm </span><span begin="02:05.041" end="02:05.366">sorry </span><span begin="02:05.630" end="02:05.998">my </span><span begin="02:05.998" end="02:06.197">sweet </span><span begin="02:06.197" end="02:06.686">baby </span><span begin="02:06.870" end="02:07.029">I </span><span begin="02:07.029" end="02:07.254">wish </span><span begin="02:07.254" end="02:07.502">I'd </span><span begin="02:07.502" end="02:07.869">been </span><span begin="02:08.038" end="02:08.486">there</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:09.494" end="02:12.094"><span begin="02:09.494" end="02:10.294">It's </span><span begin="02:10.294" end="02:10.622">been </span><span begin="02:10.622" end="02:11.109">so </span><span begin="02:11.109" end="02:11.646">long</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:12.094" end="02:14.374"><span begin="02:12.094" end="02:12.374">Since </span><span begin="02:12.374" end="02:12.606">I </span><span begin="02:12.606" end="02:12.870">last </span><span begin="02:12.870" end="02:13.158">have </span><span begin="02:13.158" end="02:13.462">seen </span><span begin="02:13.462" end="02:13.726">my </span><span begin="02:13.726" end="02:14.197">son</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:14.374" end="02:15.998"><span begin="02:14.374" end="02:14.526">Lost </span><span begin="02:14.526" end="02:14.718">to </span><span begin="02:14.718" end="02:14.918">this </span><span begin="02:14.918" end="02:15.670">monster</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:15.998" end="02:19.750"><span begin="02:15.998" end="02:16.158">To </span><span begin="02:16.158" end="02:16.310">the </span><span begin="02:16.310" end="02:16.534">man </span><span begin="02:16.534" end="02:17.014">behind </span><span begin="02:17.189" end="02:17.422">the </span><span begin="02:17.422" end="02:18.534">slaughter</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:19.750" end="02:21.942"><span begin="02:19.750" end="02:19.966">Since </span><span begin="02:19.966" end="02:20.493">you've </span><span begin="02:20.726" end="02:21.062">been </span><span begin="02:21.062" end="02:21.670">gone</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:21.942" end="02:24.334"><span begin="02:21.942" end="02:22.374">I've </span><span begin="02:22.374" end="02:22.582">been </span><span begin="02:22.582" end="02:22.902">singing </span><span begin="02:23.109" end="02:23.350">this </span><span begin="02:23.350" end="02:23.590">stupid </span><span begin="02:23.590" end="02:24.166">song</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:24.334" end="02:25.950"><span begin="02:24.334" end="02:24.493">So </span><span begin="02:24.493" end="02:24.710">I </span><span begin="02:24.710" end="02:24.958">could </span><span begin="02:24.958" end="02:25.702">ponder</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:25.950" end="02:29.054"><span begin="02:25.950" end="02:26.190">The </span><span begin="02:26.190" end="02:26.790">sanity </span><span begin="02:26.974" end="02:27.182">of </span><span begin="02:27.182" end="02:27.454">your </span><span begin="02:27.454" end="02:28.486">mother</span></p></div></body></tt>